cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TierDecay"
abstract: >-
  A per-repo learning layer for AI coding CLI model routing. It records
  predicted versus executed tiers per task class in a Markdown ledger,
  distills high-tier solutions into playbook entries, lowers a class's tier
  only after confidence-gated probe evidence, re-certifies on model or effort
  changes, and exports the learned posterior to native routers and Agent
  Skills.
authors:
